    datacenter_load_block: { cell: "K", fc: "K", ev: "SCN-WS5A-LOAD 2026-09-06 T1-F 2026-2030: the shape effect is the campaign's most precise pre-declaration - SCN-WS4b said LOAD-HI's peak sits 3.6 GW below its ORGANIC twin by 2030 and it measures 3.91 GW (180.65 vs 184.56) at 0.07 % energy difference and 0.068 Mt CO2, on a DC anchor re-derived after they wrote it. Where WS-4b disclosed two readings the PROSE wins at HEAD: I3 FAILS in REF, where the board's bare key has it passing. CO2 +72.86 Mt; 2026 reproduces WS-4c's T0 rate to 0.006 t/MWh (0.4901 vs 0.484) then crosses above 1.0 by 2030. Backstop to its cap with 42.4 TWh still shed. gas_cc_ccs 334.5/484.1 MW from 2029, no carbon program. FINDING-scn-ws5a-load-miso-2026-09-06.md POST-FIX RE-SOLVE, SCN-WS5A-RESOLVE-MISO 2026-09-06 (ruling S8, docs/handoffs/FINDING-scn-ws5a-resolve-miso-2026-09-06.md): all three legs re-solved at THE PIN bdfb3095 (post capx D77 + D65-B) under the SAME run ids, keys f1b3caa22b3f14ff / 9688b06c1b0a5a54 / b87deb7735c242a0, all five STOP gates PASS on all three, zero STOPs — G1 identity max relative deviation 0.000e+00 (bit-equal) over every retrofitted unit-year, G2/G3 2026-2027 identical to the pre-fix control for 10/10 fuels, G4 FAIL set {I3, I7, I12} unchanged. The DC-shape numbers above are UNMOVED (2026-2027 do not move at all; the arms' peak/energy relationship is untouched) and the DC-volume axis stays a shape effect on the retrofit channel too: LOAD-HI and LOAD-HI-ORGANIC carried IDENTICAL gas_cc_ccs pre-fix (3.7192 TWh / 484.1 MW at 2030) and still do post-fix (5.5455 TWh / 721.9 MW). What moves is the CO2 LEVEL from 2028: 2030 REF 412.6343 -> 410.2013 Mt (-2.4330) and LOAD-HI dCO2 72.8621 -> 72.4163 Mt (-0.4458), so the +72.86 Mt quoted above re-reads as +72.42. The fall decomposes to 0.0012 Mt: 53 % re-rating the already-CCS energy, 47 % an ENLARGED retrofit set (334.5 -> 618.1 MW at 2030, and 2028 now converts where the pre-fix run converted nothing) swapping unabated gas_cc for CCS one-for-one (-2.1833 vs +2.1861 TWh) with coal and every zero-carbon fuel identical — MISO's carbon price is zero, so the merit order does not re-order. No verdict letter moved: this is a defect repair in a consumed mechanism, not a lever test." },
