    mass_cap_schedule: { cell: ".", fc: "U", ev: "SCN-CAP (2026-09-06): field + CAP-STATE-TIGHT case landed for every ISO (rule 28c); MISO carries no cap-and-trade program (CAP_AND_TRADE_PROGRAMS), so the case resolves to NOTHING here — no row, no adder — and is byte-identical to REF (tested on the committed 2026-2030 base). Never solved on MISO. Backcast lane '.' by construction. Evidence: docs/handoffs/FINDING-scn-cap-2026-09-06.md" },
